title Room at an epoch
left to right direction
rectangle "16 windows" as Windows
rectangle "Grow +50%\n13 windows hot" as Grow
rectangle "Shrink /2\nepoch quiet" as Shrink
rectangle "Stay\nmid band" as Stay
Windows --> Grow
